    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are You Ready For The......</h2>Stupidest Touhou fan game you'll ever play on Steam...<br><br>Reimu is bored, like, really bored.<br>Sure nothing happening is pretty relaxing... but you'd probably rot if you stay home forever, so...<br>Go and beat up that idiot ice fairy probably will do the job!<br>except there is a twist, you know there is a twist i know there is a twist everyone knows there is a twist.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring</h2>Classic 2D RPG game (with crappy art),<br>Silly story that's filed with crappy jokes, and 2 ending,<br>A mix of (boring) turn based battle with bullet hell,<br>30 minutes of game play, <br><br>Oh btw<br><br>This game is filled with stupid references that no one can understand.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Last thing</h2><br>This game is made completely by me myself and I with 1.5 years (somwhow) and a handful of different tutorials on how to do stuff, quite a journey if I say so myself, however, the outcome is pretty crappy.<br><br>The quality of this game...... isn't really remotely close to fantastic, but I really hope you will enjoy it, and have a bit of fun/",
